      "writtenOn": "2026-08-25T23:45:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "How would this be any different from say Qualcomm and the db845c target? ARCH_QCOM enables a lot of support by default, including SoCs that are not viable for new certification. With ARCH_TEGRA now similarly enabling all generations by default, this change is primarily trying to undisable stuff that was previously forcibly removed by android specific changes.",
      "parentUuid": "fb507996_1a6740da",
      "revId": "eaae4856b9a5a22764b3b08f25fdf7a59878e9cc",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
